msgid "Relay Shield"
msgstr "Relay Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/relay-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Relay Shield switches two high-power AC or DC loads up to 60 W per relay"
" from the OpenMV Cam, with a 6-36 V input plus an ADC input and a digital "
"I/O line for sync."
msgstr ""
"Relay Shield z OpenMV Cam spíná dvě výkonové AC nebo DC zátěže až do 60 W na"
" relé, se vstupem 6–36 V plus ADC vstupem a digitální I/O linkou pro "
"synchronizaci."

